 .../MFront/GenericBehaviour/Integrate.hxx     | 489 +++++++++----
 .../LogarithmicStrainIntegrate.hxx            | 670 ++++++++++--------
 ...StandardFiniteStrainBehaviourIntegrate.hxx | 466 +++++++-----
 4 files changed, 1314 insertions(+), 945 deletions(-)

